    "northStar": "Museum collection interface",
    "overview": "Lumbre is a quiet workspace for reviewing photography. Steel-blue controls and broad white surfaces support images with small utilitarian captions. The user delegated this visual direction; the interface operates as a working collection rather than a decorative catalog.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Images lead, with consistent crops in the collection and uncropped viewing in the preview.",
